[node name="DisplayModeSettings" type="MarginContainer" parent="VBoxContainer/VBoxContainer/SettingContainer/VBoxContainer/SettingsOpener/TabContainer/SettingsTab/SettingsContainer/MarginContainer/SettingOptions" unique_id=571636996]
layout_mode = 2
tooltip_text = "Thumbnail Display Mode:
How thumbnails should be generated.

Editor Preview:
Uses Godot's built-in editor preview. If this shows up blank, 
you can reset it by opening the scene, centering the visible 
components in the viewport and saving it. Click the favorite 
palette again to refresh it and see the new preview.

PNG Files:
Searches recursively for png files with the same name as the `.tscn` 
or `.scn` file within the `png_file_directory` (defaults to the palette's 
directory). If none is found then it uses the editor preview mode.

Instantiate Files:
This can be used for small scenes such as pixel art. The actual
scene is instantiated and shone in the preview. Scenes that are 
not 2D or contain cameras will be ignored."

